007 - The Lord in Zion Reigneth
 / 
Key: D
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 7
Topic: Worship - 

Verse 1:
[A]The [F#m]Lord [D/F#]in [Em/G]Zion [A7/G]reigneth, [D/F#]Let all the world [A#m]rejoice,
[A7/G]And come [D/F#]before [A7]His throne [F#m]of grace With tuneful [G#m]heart and [A]voice;
[A]The Lord in [F#m/C#]Zion [D]reigneth, And [Em/B]there [Bm]His praise [A]shall [G#m]ring,
[A7/G]To [D/F#]Him [F#m]shall [A7]princes [F#m]bend the [B7]knee [Em/B]And [D/A]kings their glory [A7/G]bring.

Verse 2:
[A]The [F#m]Lord [D/F#]in [Em/G]Zion [A7/G]reigneth, [D/F#]and who so great [A#m]as He?
[A7/G]The depths [D/F#]of [F#m]earth [A7]are in [F#m]His hands; He rules [A]the [G#m]mighty [A]sea.
[A]O crown His [G/D]Name [F#m/C#]with [A]honor, [D/A]and [Em/B]let His [Bm]standard [G#m]wave,
[A7/G]Till [D/F#]distant [A7]isles [F#m]beyond the [B7]deep [Em/B]shall [D/A]own His power [A7/G]to [D/F#]save.

Verse 3:
[A]The [F#m]Lord [D/F#]in [Em/G]Zion [A7/G]reigneth, [D/F#]these hours to Him [A#m]belong;
[A7/G]O enter [F#m]now [A7]His temple [F#m]gates, and [A]fill His [G#m]courts with [A]song;
[A]Beneath His [G/D]royal [F#m/C#]banner let [D/A]every [Bm]creature [G#m]fall,
[A7/G]Exalt [F#m]the [A7]King of [F#m]heaven [B7]and [Em/B]earth, [D/A]and crown Him [A7/G]Lord of [D/F#]all.
